WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.490
Now Albert Bierstadt's The Rocky Mountains,
Lander's Peak, 1863.

2
00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.630
A Shoshone encampment sits
in the foreground,

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.980
but only as a kind of ornamental detail,

4
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.050
dwarfed by divine mountains
and theatrical light.

5
00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.280
New Yorkers seeing it during the Civil War

6
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.800
(most had never been there)
were learning to imagine the West

7
00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:22.330
as magnificence without sovereignty.
